1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,495
Why does resting in your own home

2
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:02,840
feel like getting caught?

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,340
Picture this.

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,140
You hear keys at the front door.

5
00:00:06,580 --> 00:00:07,815
A second ago, you were watching a

6
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:08,180
movie.

7
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:09,620
Now you're washing a plate.

8
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:11,280
The plate was already clean.

9
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:14,860
An hour earlier, this evening looked different.

10
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,360
Dinner was done.

11
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,860
The urgent stuff was handled.

12
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,980
You texted a friend: finally, movie time.

13
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,180
You made a snack, found the remote,

14
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:24,800
and gave yourself twenty minutes.

15
00:00:25,760 --> 00:00:27,215
Then you noticed your laptop was still

16
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:27,600
open.

17
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:30,130
One unanswered email.

18
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:32,230
It could wait until tomorrow.

19
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:33,510
You knew that.

20
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:35,330
But answering it would take two minutes.

21
00:00:35,850 --> 00:00:37,545
Then you could relax without it hanging

22
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:38,290
over you.

23
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:40,845
You put the snack down, crossed the

24
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:42,350
room, and pulled the chair out.

25
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:44,760
You sent the reply.

26
00:00:45,620 --> 00:00:46,840
Another message arrived.

27
00:00:47,400 --> 00:00:49,560
Apparently your inbox had learned to reproduce.

28
00:00:50,080 --> 00:00:51,200
You opened that one too.

29
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,100
Now you needed a document.

30
00:00:53,800 --> 00:00:55,440
The document needed a correction.

31
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:57,355
Your movie was still waiting for you

32
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:58,060
to press play.

33
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:00,020
The snack was getting cold.

34
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:01,780
Your phone rang.

35
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:04,040
The timer. Twenty minutes were up.

36
00:01:04,580 --> 00:01:06,195
You had successfully completed your break

37
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,880
without experiencing any of it.

38
00:01:08,520 --> 00:01:10,675
You silenced the alarm and reached for

39
00:01:10,680 --> 00:01:11,460
the laptop again.

40
00:01:11,900 --> 00:01:12,760
Just finish this.

41
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:14,915
Then you could finally stop thinking about

42
00:01:14,920 --> 00:01:15,240
work.

43
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:17,920
Then your friend texted.

44
00:01:18,540 --> 00:01:20,495
They'd spent the afternoon lying around and

45
00:01:20,500 --> 00:01:21,640
felt terrible about it.

46
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,360
Your reply came easily:

47
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:24,420
you were exhausted.

48
00:01:25,180 --> 00:01:25,940
You needed a break.

49
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:27,320
You hit send.

50
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:29,935
A moment later, they asked: how's the

51
00:01:29,940 --> 00:01:30,260
movie?

52
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:32,100
You looked at the untouched remote.

53
00:01:33,720 --> 00:01:35,880
You started typing: haven't earned it yet.

54
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:36,880
Then stopped.

55
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:39,200
You wouldn't actually send that.

56
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:40,700
It sounded ridiculous.

57
00:01:41,300 --> 00:01:43,035
But looking at your evening, wasn't that

58
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:44,180
the rule you were following?

59
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:46,455
Your friend could rest because they were

60
00:01:46,460 --> 00:01:46,840
tired.

61
00:01:47,340 --> 00:01:49,420
You needed evidence that you'd done enough.

62
00:01:51,600 --> 00:01:53,155
Maybe that's part of what makes rest

63
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:53,880
uncomfortable.

64
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:56,655
If being useful has become a condition

65
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:58,460
for feeling okay about yourself,

66
00:01:59,200 --> 00:02:01,480
an unfinished task can feel personal.

67
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,880
The document can wait until morning.

68
00:02:04,600 --> 00:02:06,695
But can you feel okay about yourself

69
00:02:06,700 --> 00:02:07,400
while it waits?

70
00:02:08,620 --> 00:02:10,835
Research has linked seeing leisure as wasted

71
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,680
time with enjoying it less.

72
00:02:13,540 --> 00:02:15,380
That doesn't explain everyone's guilt.

73
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:17,695
In this story, though, every attempt to

74
00:02:17,700 --> 00:02:19,120
relax comes with an inspection:

75
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:21,080
have I justified this yet?

76
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:23,635
Imagine watching a movie while somebody keeps

77
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:24,900
asking for your receipt.

78
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:28,460
Sometimes the pressure comes from outside.

79
00:02:29,340 --> 00:02:30,900
A boss expects evening replies.

80
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,880
Housework isn't shared fairly.

81
00:02:33,620 --> 00:02:34,820
Someone depends on you.

82
00:02:35,100 --> 00:02:37,515
Those situations may need practical help or

83
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:37,920
boundaries.

84
00:02:38,460 --> 00:02:40,460
But tonight, the urgent work is done.

85
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,375
Nobody has asked you to open that

86
00:02:42,380 --> 00:02:43,120
laptop again.

87
00:02:44,080 --> 00:02:44,980
You look at the document.

88
00:02:45,560 --> 00:02:46,740
One correction can wait.

89
00:02:47,120 --> 00:02:48,675
You write yourself a note: fix this

90
00:02:48,680 --> 00:02:49,720
tomorrow after breakfast.

91
00:02:50,540 --> 00:02:51,400
Then you close the laptop.

92
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,255
You take the snack back to the

93
00:02:53,260 --> 00:02:53,560
couch.

94
00:02:54,240 --> 00:02:56,335
This time, you press play before finding

95
00:02:56,340 --> 00:02:57,560
another reason to leave.

96
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:01,655
And right then, keys turn in the

97
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:01,980
door.

98
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:03,600
Your shoulders tighten.

99
00:03:04,300 --> 00:03:05,580
The familiar thought arrives:

100
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:06,980
look busy.

101
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:08,695
You hurry to the sink and grab

102
00:03:08,700 --> 00:03:09,960
a plate from the drying rack.

103
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:12,140
Under the running water, you notice it.

104
00:03:12,460 --> 00:03:13,880
This plate was already clean.

105
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,280
Your roommate walks in.

106
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,920
Hey. How was your night?

107
00:03:19,420 --> 00:03:20,775
You almost say you were just cleaning

108
00:03:20,780 --> 00:03:23,200
up. Instead, you turn off the faucet.

109
00:03:23,500 --> 00:03:24,460
Set the plate down.

110
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,460
Your mouth starts forming an explanation.

111
00:03:27,260 --> 00:03:28,380
You let that go too.

112
00:03:28,940 --> 00:03:30,020
I was watching a movie.

113
00:03:32,060 --> 00:03:33,780
Any good? You shake your head.

114
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:34,840
You don't know yet.

115
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:35,960
You've barely started.

116
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:37,300
You sit back down.

117
00:03:37,920 --> 00:03:39,255
Your roommate takes a piece of your

118
00:03:39,260 --> 00:03:40,980
snack and heads down the hall.

119
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,080
That's it.

120
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:43,080
No inspection.

121
00:03:43,640 --> 00:03:44,935
You pick up the remote and find

122
00:03:44,940 --> 00:03:45,480
your place.

123
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:49,040
The guilt hasn't magically disappeared.

124
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:51,000
Neither has tomorrow's work.

125
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:53,335
But this time, you stay for the

126
00:03:53,340 --> 00:03:53,920
next scene.

127
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:54,960
Then the next.

128
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,060
You let the movie hold your attention.

129
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,615
And you let someone see you resting,

130
00:03:59,620 --> 00:04:01,115
without trying to make it look like

131
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:01,800
something else.
